"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line018","quote":"權既稱尊號，昭以老病，上還官位及所統領。更拜輔呉將軍，班亞三司，改封婁侯，食邑萬戸。在裡宅無事，乃著《春秋左氏傳》解及《論語》注。權嘗問衞尉嚴畯：\"寧念小時所暗書不？\"畯因誦《孝經》\"仲尼居\"。昭曰：\"嚴畯鄙生，臣請爲陛下誦之。\"乃誦\"君子之事上\"，鹹以昭爲知所誦。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line018:m0070"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-wu052-zz-main-13:a","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line018","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"衞尉","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangzhao-complete:line018:m0070","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本來源官稱或所任，未受另記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032","text":"承字仲嗣，少以才學知名，與諸葛瑾、歩騭、嚴畯相友善。權爲驃騎將軍，辟西曹掾，出爲長沙西部都尉。討平山寇，得精兵萬五千人。後爲濡須都督、奮威將軍，封都鄕侯，領部曲五千人。承爲人壯毅忠讜，能甄識人物，拔彭城蔡款、南陽謝景於孤微童幼，後並爲國士，款至衞尉，景豫章太守。又諸葛恪年少時，眾人奇其英才。承言終敗諸葛氏者，元遜也。勤於長進，篤於物類，凡在庶幾之流，無不造門，年六十七，赤烏七年卒，謚曰定侯。子震嗣。初，承喪妻，昭欲爲索諸葛瑾女，承以相與有好，難之，權聞而勸焉，遂爲婿。生女，權爲子和納之。權數令和修敬於承，執子婿之禮。震諸葛恪誅時亦死。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"承","kind":"person","person_id":"roi_rz4_ute_B","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"仲嗣","kind":"person","person_id":"roi_rz4_ute_B","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-052-zhangcheng-complete:line032:m0013","star